In Azure infra (via Terraform), upgrades can involve:

Resource configuration change (SKU, size, TLS version, etc.)
Azure API / provider upgrade (azurerm version)
OS / platform upgrade (VM, AKS, App Service)
Security changes (network rules, access policies

✅ 2. PRE-UPGRADE CHECKLIST (Very Important)
🔍 A. Terraform-Level Checks
Run:
terraform init -upgrade
terraform planShow more lines
Check:

❌ Any resource marked for destroy
⚠️ Any force replacement
✅ Only expected changes

C. Dependency Check
Example:

Storage account → used by:
App Service
Functions
AKS
Diagnostic logs


✅ Validate:
No breaking dependency
No change in resource ID

🔍 D. Service-Specific Checks
✅ Storage Account (very critical)
Before upgrading:

Check redundancy:
LRS / GRS / ZRS
Check:
Private endpoints
Firewall rules
Access keys (used anywhere?)


Check:
Blob lifecycle policies
TLS version

Confirm:
No accidental recreation

⚠️ Risk:
Changing name, kind, or replication → forces recreation (DATA LOSS RISK)

✅ Networking

VNets / Subnets:
Any CIDR change? (very risky)

NSGs:
Rules not blocking production traffic
Private endpoints:
Still mapped correctly

✅ Compute (VM / VMSS / AKS)
Check:
Scaling behavior
OS / image version

For AKS:
Node pool upgrade strategy
Pod disruption budget

✅ Identity & Access
Managed identities intact?
RBAC roles unchanged?
Key Vault access working?


✅ Monitoring & Logs
Diagnostic settings still configured?
Log Analytics workspace connected?

🎯 Upgrade Patterns
✔️ Safe (In-place)
SKU upgrade (Storage, App Service)
TLS version update

✔️ Rolling Upgrade
VMSS upgrade
AKS node pool upgrade

✔️ Blue-Green (HIGHLY USED)
Create new infra
Switch traffic
Alerts preserved?


4. POST-UPGRADE CHECKS (Critical)
After upgrade, engineers verify EVERYTHING 👇
🔍 A. Terraform Validation

Run again:

terraform plan
✅ Expect:
No changes (clean state)


🔍 B. Resource Health Check (Azure Portal / CLI)
✅ Storage Account
Accessible?
Blob read/write working?
Private endpoint working?
Firewall rules intact?

Test:
Shellaz storage blob list ...Show more lines

✅ App / API Layer
Application up and running?
No 5xx errors?
Response time OK?


✅ Networking
DNS resolving correctly?
Load balancer routing traffic?
No blocked traffic?


✅ Monitoring (VERY IMPORTANT for you 👇)

Check:
Logs ingestion
Metrics continuity
Alerts firing
✅ Tools:
Azure Monitor
Dynatrace (check anomaly detection)


✅ Security Validation
RBAC access working?
Key Vault secrets accessible?
No unauthorized exposure?


